      "description": "<p>You picked up a @UUID[Item.fpVKlZEUPEQQt344]{Maintenance Jack} during a colony siege. It got your squad into the heart of the complex where the fight was won. You kept hold of this useful tool, which works so well it gives an additional bonus +1 to <strong>HEAVY MACHINERY</strong> when using it.</p>",
