      "description": "<p>During a colony virus outbreak everyone ran out of ammo and your squad retreated to the Marshal’s office where you fought off the infected colonists. You still have the 12-gauge shotgun you used that day. @UUID[Item.F5WlHrEw1FuGJyXr]{Armat Model 37A2 12 Gauge Pump Action}</p>",
      "name": "",
