      "description": "<p>You threw yourself in front of a colonist and saved them from an insurgent attack. Your M3 armor saved you and you saved the colonist. You gained a Marine Commendation Medal and the @UUID[Item.vD9HtUwctZDgBF6r]{Bodyguard} talent.</p>",
